What is a Hearth?
Hearth products encompass indoor heating apparatuses including fireplaces, stoves, and inserts. Originating in Europe, these systems have evolved to offer both functional heating and aesthetic value, utilizing various fuel sources like wood, pellets, and gas. Modern hearths combine traditional warmth with contemporary design, serving as focal points in homes while providing supplemental heating solutions in colder climates.
